    {
      "id": "y0_hGtysSkcJLXjXUQL-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2877.434303423393,
      "y": 3233.940987824451,
      "width": 416,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 232076870,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 1457017434,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788944086313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "随机 GUID 做聚集索引是性能灾难\nMySQL  的InnoDB 引擎默认是聚集\n\n随机插入： 新数据可能落在任何位置 →页分裂 → 性能灾难\n有序插入： 新数据永远在末尾 → 很少触发页分裂",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "随机 GUID 做聚集索引是性能灾难\nMySQL  的InnoDB 引擎默认是聚集\n\n随机插入： 新数据可能落在任何位置 →页分裂 → 性能灾难\n有序插入： 新数据永远在末尾 → 很少触发页分裂",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
