      "text": "查询用 FromSql：\n        .FromSql($\"SELECT * FROM Blogs WHERE Id = {id}\")\n\n非查询用 ExecuteSql：\n        .ExecuteSql($\"UPDATE Blogs SET Rating = {rating} WHERE Id = {id}\")",
