      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "删除、更新不高效问题",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "NbSS1wZwZWXBXCsYdhNip",
      "originalText": "删除、更新不高效问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zjbZGmSoa6ZQJYHszYHgD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3703.5789173693047,
      "y": 2157.656999046214,
      "width": 675,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "DeVxCTroJAJFbSBM-x644"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 556327706,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 930917830,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789353947715,
      "created": 1789353877143,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "先查库、加载所有实体到内存，然后为每一条记录生成单独的 DELETE 语句，逐条处理\n\nEF Core 7.0 正式引入了 ExecuteUpdate 和 ExecuteDelete，专门解决高效批量更新/删除的问题",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "先查库、加载所有实体到内存，然后为每一条记录生成单独的 DELETE 语句，逐条处理\n\nEF Core 7.0 正式引入了 ExecuteUpdate 和 ExecuteDelete，专门解决高效批量更新/删除的问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IjFq9-UAN0dfPqGK_soKP",
