      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "全局查询筛选器",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "全局查询筛选器",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xr_byjd5H5NTF6QPcEC5s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3697.1548756327584,
      "y": 2300.8062204990533,
      "width": 1217.7886186247788,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2086124294,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 2106725446,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789355569121,
      "created": 1789355544013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "核心用途\n\n软删除：实体加个 IsDeleted 属性，配置 HasQueryFilter(b => !b.IsDeleted) 后，已“删除”的数据在查询中自动隐藏，但实际上还在数据库里。\n\n多租户隔离：在多租户系统中，每个实体带 TenantId，筛选器自动只返回当前租户的数据，防止跨租户数据泄露",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "核心用途\n\n软删除：实体加个 IsDeleted 属性，配置 HasQueryFilter(b => !b.IsDeleted) 后，已“删除”的数据在查询中自动隐藏，但实际上还在数据库里。\n\n多租户隔离：在多租户系统中，每个实体带 TenantId，筛选器自动只返回当前租户的数据，防止跨租户数据泄露",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xGeum4uXq_k0UX92LU4in",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3641.422492846721,
      "y": 2464.9605134282374,
      "width": 197,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1523161434,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 435061402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789356656823,
      "created": 1789356650635,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "乐观并发 vs 悲观并发",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "乐观并发 vs 悲观并发",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bN4YTQvDkE85O6LtjBfXn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3697.6402690021405,
      "y": 2503.7717352703426,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 776872986,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1463700634,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789357249886,
      "created": 1789356713851,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "乐观并发是“先放行，提交时对令牌”，悲观并发是“先锁门，别人门外等”",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "乐观并发是“先放行，提交时对令牌”，悲观并发是“先锁门，别人门外等”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eZKVfoe9Cuz3P07xIFxMF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3633.2995743173383,
      "y": 2599.2762284934365,
      "width": 530.4440407333313,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1509920282,
      "version": 318,
      "versionNonce": 545421382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789357057803,
      "created": 1789356768220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "using var tx = await db.Database.BeginTransactionAsync();\n\n// 加锁查询，其他事务想改这行就得等\nvar coupon = await db.Coupons\n    .FromSql($\"SELECT * FROM \\\"Coupons\\\" WHERE \\\"Id\\\" =\n{id} FOR UPDATE\")\n    .SingleOrDefaultAsync();\n\nif (coupon != null)\n{\n    coupon.RedemptionsRemaining -= 1;\n    await db.SaveChangesAsync();\n}\n\nawait tx.CommitAsync();  // 提交后锁释放",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "using var tx = await db.Database.BeginTransactionAsync();\n\n// 加锁查询，其他事务想改这行就得等\nvar coupon = await db.Coupons\n    .FromSql($\"SELECT * FROM \\\"Coupons\\\" WHERE \\\"Id\\\" = {id} FOR UPDATE\")\n    .SingleOrDefaultAsync();\n\nif (coupon != null)\n{\n    coupon.RedemptionsRemaining -= 1;\n    await db.SaveChangesAsync();\n}\n\nawait tx.CommitAsync();  // 提交后锁释放",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "el_RGjGCQFauM049YsZ0U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3631.479942234808,
      "y": 2922.6065578277025,
      "width": 569,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 369591450,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 382688070,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789357135358,
      "created": 1789356789944,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "悲观锁EF Core 没有内置 API，必须通过数据库特定的原生 SQL 在事务中加锁\n\nPostgreSQL 的悲观锁通过 SELECT ... FOR UPDATE 实现",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "悲观锁EF Core 没有内置 API，必须通过数据库特定的原生 SQL 在事务中加锁\n\nPostgreSQL 的悲观锁通过 SELECT ... FOR UPDATE 实现",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "89gNHX0w4MsAHBPjUuEZ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4239.839084575396,
      "y": 2608.953871652595,
      "width": 423,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1831062278,
      "version": 474,
      "versionNonce": 198463322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789357302554,
      "created": 1789356925868,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "modelBuilder.Entity<Customer>()\n    .Property(c => c.LastModified)\n    .IsConcurrencyToken();  // 比较时同时比较这列",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "modelBuilder.Entity<Customer>()\n    .Property(c => c.LastModified)\n    .IsConcurrencyToken();  // 比较时同时比较这列",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3x6qdRIsLkydcXvV2xzFC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4225.959066087108,
      "y": 2923.7090858401807,
      "width": 480.0819461542589,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 870342086,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 199951174,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789357292371,
      "created": 1789356937908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "乐观并发依赖一个并发令牌（Concurrency Token），EF Core\n会在提交时用它来检查数据是否被改过\n\n读的时候记下一个版本标记，写的时候拿这个标记去比对。对得上说\n明中间没人动过，对不上说明有人动过，于是报错。\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "乐观并发依赖一个并发令牌（Concurrency Token），EF Core 会在提交时用它来检查数据是否被改过\n\n读的时候记下一个版本标记，写的时候拿这个标记去比对。对得上说明中间没人动过，对不上说明有人动过，于是报错。\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FCx6bi8toCyTt7YALCKMb",
      "type": "text",
